# Problem specific Data:
# ---------------------
#
# Benchmark workload. Do not edit: the evaluation harness re-runs the solver
# with this exact file and compares the resulting DIGEST line to a reference.
#
# eps 0.0 makes the residual test never trigger, so the solver performs
# exactly `itermax` sweeps. Every variant therefore does the same amount of
# arithmetic and the only thing that differs is how long it takes.

name poisson

# Geometry Data:
# -------------

xlength    1.0		# domain size in x-direction
ylength    1.0		# domain size in y-direction
imax       8192		# number of interior cells in x-direction
jmax       8192		# number of interior cells in y-direction

# Pressure Iteration Data:
# -----------------------

itermax  300		# number of pressure iteration sweeps (fixed)
eps      0.0		# stopping tolerance for pressure iteration (disabled)
rho      0.99999		# relaxation parameter for SOR iteration
omg      1.2		# relaxation parameter for SOR iteration

#===============================================================================
